{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X 对人物行为动机的解释和前后段落之间的因果衔接不如 Y 充分，有些心理转折需要观众自行补足。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 的重点短而醒目，主旨容易抓住，感受又能随着音乐逐步出现，不必在有限时间里一次读完所有文字；具体的声音、光线、身体感受也有层次变化，细腻度更好。Y 的优势是把人物为什么这样想、前后为什么发生变化交代得更完整，叙事连贯性更强，但左栏解释句偏长，部分短时段不容易边听边扫完。综合实际观看体验，我更愿意选 X：它更容易让我在音乐进行中及时抓住情绪和段落重点，Y 则更适合完整阅读和理解人物心理。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0055f1ca-d84c-4e41-a8a2-cc40c4036f80", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T084031705396Z", "elapsed_seconds": 62.563, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T08:41:34.281267+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "eeeb45669442855467eb15d585881b871746a9a3d655085982ed0a6010cf136d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgp